{"seq":2,"slug":"liquidity-risk-contingency","title":"流动性风险与应急额度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/treasury-risk-metric/liquidity-risk-contingency","wordCount":1963,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"流动性风险与应急额度\">流动性风险与应急额度</h1><p>资金池在平稳时期显得理所当然：余额自动归集、缺口自动补足、利率自动计算。它的脆弱性在压力下才暴露——当多个成员的缺口同时出现、当某家合作银行收紧授信、当一笔预期的大额回款没到，池子里的钱可能在一个下午就调度不开。流动性风险管理的目标不是让这种情况永不发生，而是<strong>事先知道缺口有多大、能用什么工具补、补的成本是多少</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流动性风险是&quot;到期不能以合理成本履约&quot;的风险，它有两个来源：<strong>期限错配</strong>（短期负债支撑长期资产）与<strong>集中度</strong>（资金或额度过度依赖单一来源）。资金池本身的归集机制降低了第一类风险（内部资金互相补足），却可能放大第二类——如果全集团的备用额度都来自同一家银行，那么这家银行一旦收紧，全集团同时失去后备。</p>\n<p>监管对银行侧的要求给出了可借鉴的框架：流动性覆盖率要求银行持有的优质流动性资产足以覆盖<strong>30 个日历日</strong>压力情景下的净现金流出，<strong>100% 的 LCR 是正常时期的最低要求</strong>，压力期可以动用优质资产并暂时低于该水平（见 <a href=\"https://www.bis.org/publ/bcbs238.pdf\">Basel III 流动性覆盖率标准</a>）。集团司库的对应做法是定义自己的压力情景与覆盖天数，只是分母换成集团的净现金流出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[流动性风险识别] --&gt; B[期限错配 缺口日历]&#10;    A --&gt; C[集中度 银行与工具]&#10;    A --&gt; D[或有负债 担保与承诺]&#10;    B --&gt; E[压力情景设定]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[轻度 / 中度 / 重度]&#10;    F --&gt; G[各情景缺口规模]&#10;    G --&gt; H[覆盖工具排序]&#10;    H --&gt; I[自有现金 优质资产]&#10;    H --&gt; J[未提用承诺额度]&#10;    H --&gt; K[应急融资安排]&#10;    I --&gt; L[应急计划 CFP]&#10;    J --&gt; L&#10;    K --&gt; L\">graph TD\n    A[流动性风险识别] --&gt; B[期限错配 缺口日历]\n    A --&gt; C[集中度 银行与工具]\n    A --&gt; D[或有负债 担保与承诺]\n    B --&gt; E[压力情景设定]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[轻度 / 中度 / 重度]\n    F --&gt; G[各情景缺口规模]\n    G --&gt; H[覆盖工具排序]\n    H --&gt; I[自有现金 优质资产]\n    H --&gt; J[未提用承诺额度]\n    H --&gt; K[应急融资安排]\n    I --&gt; L[应急计划 CFP]\n    J --&gt; L\n    K --&gt; L</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险来源</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>缓释手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>期限错配</td>\n<td>短期集中到期</td>\n<td>缺口日历、期限分散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行集中度</td>\n<td>额度依赖单一银行</td>\n<td>多行策略、承诺额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种错配</td>\n<td>有资产但币种不对</td>\n<td>交叉货币额度、掉期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>或有负债</td>\n<td>担保触发、保函赔付</td>\n<td>或有负债台账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集团内部传染</td>\n<td>一个成员挤占池内资金</td>\n<td>分成员额度与优先级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缺口日历-把风险量化到天\">缺口日历：把风险量化到天</h2><h3 id=\"缺口日历的构建\">缺口日历的构建</h3><p>流动性风险只有在按日展开时才看得清。缺口日历把未来一段时间内每个时点的可用资金与应付资金对齐，给出每天的净缺口。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Gap</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>OpeningCash</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>Inflows</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>Outflows</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>CommittedOutflows</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Gap}\\_t = \\text{OpeningCash}\\_t + \\text{Inflows}\\_t - \\text{Outflows}\\_t - \\text{CommittedOutflows}\\_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gap</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OpeningCash</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Inflows</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Outflows</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CommittedOutflows</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>CommittedOutflows</code> 是即使压力下也必须履行的支付（工资、税费、到期债务本息、已开立保函的赔付义务），与可推迟的支付（供应商货款、内部划转）区别对待。这个区分是缺口日历的核心——压力情景下首先推迟的是可推迟项。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH cal AS (&#10;  SELECT d.bucket_date,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN d.item_type = &#39;opening&#39;            THEN d.amount ELSE 0 END) AS opening_cash,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN d.item_type = &#39;inflow&#39;             THEN d.amount ELSE 0 END) AS inflows,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN d.item_type = &#39;outflow_discretionary&#39; THEN d.amount ELSE 0 END) AS discretionary,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN d.item_type = &#39;outflow_committed&#39;  THEN d.amount ELSE 0 END) AS committed&#10;  FROM liquidity_calendar_item d&#10;  WHERE d.base_currency = &#39;EUR&#39;&#10;    AND d.bucket_date BETWEEN DATE &#39;2026-09-29&#39; AND DATE &#39;2026-12-31&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY d.bucket_date&#10;)&#10;SELECT bucket_date,&#10;       opening_cash + inflows - committed                       AS net_before_discretionary,&#10;       opening_cash + inflows - committed - discretionary       AS net_after_discretionary,&#10;       SUM(opening_cash + inflows - committed)&#10;         OVER (ORDER BY bucket_date)                            AS cumulative_net,&#10;       MIN(SUM(opening_cash + inflows - committed)&#10;         OVER (ORDER BY bucket_date))                           AS worst_cumulative&#10;FROM cal&#10;ORDER BY bucket_date;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'opening'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opening_cash,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'inflow'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inflows,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'outflow_discretionary'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> discretionary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'outflow_committed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> liquidity_calendar_item d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base_currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EUR'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-29'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-12-31'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       opening_cash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inflows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                       AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_before_discretionary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       opening_cash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inflows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> discretionary       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_after_discretionary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(opening_cash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inflows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_date)                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cumulative_net,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(opening_cash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inflows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_date))                           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> worst_cumulative</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_date;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cumulative_net</code> 的<strong>最小值</strong>（<code>worst_cumulative</code>）是流动性风险的关键指标——它不是某一天的缺口，而是整个考察期内累计口径下的最差点。这个数字决定了需要持有的缓冲规模。</p>\n<h3 id=\"压力情景的设计\">压力情景的设计</h3><p>情景设计要有明确的冲击维度，而不是笼统的&quot;情况变糟&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情景</th>\n<th>冲击假设</th>\n<th>主要影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轻度</td>\n<td>回款延迟 15 天，授信额度不变</td>\n<td>缺口前移，可延后支付对冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中度</td>\n<td>回款延迟 30 天，一家银行收紧 50% 额度</td>\n<td>需要动用备用额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重度</td>\n<td>回款延迟 60 天，多家银行收紧，评级下调</td>\n<td>需要应急融资与资产变现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合</td>\n<td>中度 + 汇率不利变动 10%</td>\n<td>外币缺口放大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>情景的冲击强度应当与集团的实际敞口结构挂钩，而不是照搬监管的通用参数。重资产、长账期的集团对回款延迟更敏感；依赖短期授信的集团对额度收紧更敏感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应急额度体系\">应急额度体系</h2><h3 id=\"额度的层次\">额度的层次</h3><p>应急容量按<strong>确定性</strong>从高到低排列，实际动用时按此顺序取用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>确定性</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一</td>\n<td>自有现金与高流动性资产</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最低（机会成本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二</td>\n<td>已承诺未提用授信额度</td>\n<td>高（有合同约束）</td>\n<td>承诺费 + 利息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三</td>\n<td>未承诺授信</td>\n<td>中（银行可拒）</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四</td>\n<td>资产变现（短期投资）</td>\n<td>中（取决于市场）</td>\n<td>市价损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>五</td>\n<td>应急融资（新融资、股东支持）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最高、耗时最长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>已承诺额度的价值远高于未承诺额度</strong>——前者的法律约束力意味着银行在压力下不能随意撤回，代价是承诺费。集团在正常时期就应把足够比例的备用容量做成承诺额度，而不是等到压力出现再去谈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"额度集中度的度量\">额度集中度的度量</h3><p>备用额度的集中度需要单独度量，不能只看资金余额的集中度。以单一银行占全部备用额度的比例衡量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>bank</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>单一银行</mtext></mrow><msub><mtext>committed</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>all</mtext></munder><mtext>committed</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C*{\\text{bank}} = \\frac{\\sum*{b \\in \\text{单一银行}} \\text{committed}_b}{\\sum_{\\text{all}} \\text{committed}\\_b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bank</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.423em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">committed</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单一银行</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">committed</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个比例超过某一阈值（常见约定是 30%–40%）时应触发分散化要求。度量口径与<a href=\"treasury-yield-efficiency-kpi\">资金归集率/融资成本/收益率度量</a>的其他指标一并进司库看板。</p>\n<h3 id=\"币种错配的处理\">币种错配的处理</h3><p>有资产但币种不对，在压力下是致命的——尤其是当本币急贬、外币融资渠道同时收紧时。处理方式有两种：预先建立<strong>交叉货币额度</strong>（可直接以外币提用），或依赖<strong>外汇掉期市场</strong>临时换汇（压力下掉期市场可能同时失灵）。稳健的做法是两者兼有，且明确各自的触发条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应急计划与执行\">应急计划与执行</h2><h3 id=\"应急计划的必备要素\">应急计划的必备要素</h3><p>应急计划（contingency funding plan）不是一份文件，而是一套可执行的预案，需包含：触发条件（什么指标到什么水平启动）、决策权限（谁有权启动哪一层工具）、执行步骤（每层工具的联系人、所需材料、预计耗时）、沟通安排（对内、对银行、对评级机构的口径）。</p>\n<p>触发条件应当是<strong>量化且分层的</strong>，例如跟踪一个覆盖比率指标并设两级触发：跌破某水平进入警戒（启动监测与预备沟通），跌破更低水平进入行动（启动第二层工具）。只设一个阈值的预案在实操中会因犹豫而延误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"额度可得性的持续验证\">额度可得性的持续验证</h3><p>备用额度最大的风险是&quot;以为有、其实没有&quot;。验证手段有三：定期确认额度的可用状态（是否有未满足的提用条件、是否有财务契约限制）、定期小额提用以保持额度活跃、定期评估银行自身的信用状况（银行出问题时额度可能形同虚设）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;planId&quot;: &quot;CFP-2026&quot;,&#10;  &quot;triggers&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;watch&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;coverage_ratio&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;&lt;&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 1.5, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;monitor_and_prepare&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;action&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;coverage_ratio&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;&lt;&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 1.0, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;activate_tier2&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;severe&quot;, &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;coverage_ratio&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;&lt;&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.7, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;activate_tier3_plus&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;capacity&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;tier1_own_cash&quot;: 12000000,&#10;    &quot;tier2_committed_unused&quot;: 8000000,&#10;    &quot;tier3_uncommitted&quot;: 5000000,&#10;    &quot;tier4_liquidate_investments&quot;: 3000000&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;concentrationLimit&quot;: { &quot;singleBankCommittedPct&quot;: 35 },&#10;  &quot;reviewCadence&quot;: &quot;quarterly&quot;,&#10;  &quot;contacts&quot;: { &quot;primaryBank&quot;: &quot;treasury-desk&quot;, &quot;backupBank&quot;: &quot;regional-desk&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"planId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CFP-2026\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"triggers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"watch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coverage_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"monitor_and_prepare\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coverage_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"activate_tier2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"severe\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coverage_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"activate_tier3_plus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"capacity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tier1_own_cash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tier2_committed_unused\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tier3_uncommitted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tier4_liquidate_investments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"concentrationLimit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"singleBankCommittedPct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reviewCadence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quarterly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"contacts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"primaryBank\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"treasury-desk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"backupBank\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"regional-desk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>coverage_ratio</code> 定义为可用流动性容量与压力情景净缺口的比值，是连接缺口日历与应急容量的单一指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流动性风险来自期限错配与集中度；资金池缓解前者，却可能放大后者。</li>\n<li>缺口日历要区分必须履行的支付与可推迟的支付，累计口径的<strong>最差点</strong>才是关键指标。</li>\n<li>压力情景须有明确冲击维度（回款延迟、额度收紧、汇率不利），强度与实际敞口结构挂钩。</li>\n<li>应急容量按确定性分层：自有现金 → 已承诺额度 → 未承诺额度 → 资产变现 → 应急融资。</li>\n<li>已承诺额度价值远高于未承诺额度；备用额度的银行集中度需单独度量并设阈值。</li>\n<li>应急计划的触发条件应量化且分层，只设单一阈值会导致犹豫延误。</li>\n<li>额度可得性需持续验证：确认提用条件、保持额度活跃、评估银行自身信用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流动性风险与应急额度","id":"流动性风险与应急额度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缺口日历：把风险量化到天","id":"缺口日历-把风险量化到天"},{"level":3,"text":"缺口日历的构建","id":"缺口日历的构建"},{"level":3,"text":"压力情景的设计","id":"压力情景的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"应急额度体系","id":"应急额度体系"},{"level":3,"text":"额度的层次","id":"额度的层次"},{"level":3,"text":"额度集中度的度量","id":"额度集中度的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"币种错配的处理","id":"币种错配的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"应急计划与执行","id":"应急计划与执行"},{"level":3,"text":"应急计划的必备要素","id":"应急计划的必备要素"},{"level":3,"text":"额度可得性的持续验证","id":"额度可得性的持续验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"资金头寸外汇敞口与对冲策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/treasury-risk-metric/fx-exposure-hedge-policy"},"next":{"title":"资金归集率/融资成本/收益率度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/treasury-risk-metric/treasury-yield-efficiency-kpi"}}